#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md:9
#: 7c425205c2de4b18948b49a7cf34364b
msgid ""
"Listed in the [arms_ros2_control README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/README.md). The launch stack does **not**"
" take `gripper:=`. Attach an end-effector with `type` / `left_type` / "
"`right_type` (and optional `robot_profile` / `use_profile_eef`) from "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"launch 栈**没有** `gripper:=`。用 "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md) 的 `type` / `left_type`"
" / `right_type`（以及可选的 `robot_profile` / "
"`use_profile_eef`）挂载末端。本控制器能加载的手/夹爪由这些末端键拉起，而不是单独的 `gripper` 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md:11
#: e740a404cb9d4a8ebb668ea090b4e6e3
msgid ""
"Topics, plugin class names, and command examples: see that package’s "
"README."
msgstr "话题、插件类名和命令示例：见该包 README。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md:13
#: 7a61cf50db054b4da7b9b8b28f7e8079
msgid ""
"The command package in the same repo is `command/` "
"(`arms_target_manager`, `arms_teleop`, …). There is no "
"`arms_teleop_controller` / `target_manager_controller`. Demo launch "
"starts `arms_target_manager` when `enable_arms_target_manager` is `true`."
msgstr ""
"同一仓库的 command 包在 `command/`（`arms_target_manager`、`arms_teleop` 等）。没有 "
"`arms_teleop_controller` / `target_manager_controller`。当 "
"`enable_arms_target_manager` 为 `true` 时，演示 launch 会启动 "
"`arms_target_manager`。"

